@crew lemaire-nils
// Writer (command), batch 2: everyday lines (greet, feel, near, life, joy) from the card and the roster.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Hello. Lemaire, Survey, nights. I carry samples. One day I'll name a star.
? tier>=acquaintance
- Hi, {me}. Why did the comet skip breakfast? It was running late. Sorry.   #funny
- {hi}, {me}. Sweep tonight. I'll be the one carrying the boxes.
? tier>=friend
- {hi}, {me}. You laughed at the comet joke. Nobody laughs at the comet joke.   #warm
== feel
? mood:high
- Good night! Dr. Sato said my labels were "acceptable". I'm framing that.   #funny
? mood:low
- No joke today. Bad night. Tomorrow's will be twice as bad, to make up.
== near
? act:breakfast
- Karin's joke today was worse than mine. I'm furious. And proud.   #funny
? habit:music
- Music room, then sleep. Night shift lives backwards. It works, mostly.
== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I ran a market stall on the Ostrander colonies. I still sell ideas. Nobody buys.   #funny
== joy
? tier>=colleague
- My list of star names. For stars nobody's found yet. Somebody has to be ready.
